## Prerequisites & Downloads

### Required Software

| Software | Version | Download |
|----------|---------|----------|
| **Python** | 3.10+ | https://www.python.org/downloads/ |
| **Node.js** | 16+ | https://nodejs.org/ |
| **PostgreSQL** | 13+ | https://www.postgresql.org/download/windows/ |
| **Git** | Latest | https://git-scm.com/download/win |

### Verify Installation

Open **Command Prompt** or **PowerShell** and check:

```bash
# Check Python
python --version
# Should output: Python 3.10+ 

# Check Node.js
node --version
npm --version
# Should output: v16+

# Check Git
git --version
# Should output: git version 2.x+

# Check PostgreSQL
psql --version
# Should output: psql (PostgreSQL) 13+